==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|qvikker}}, {{m|gmq-osw|qviker}}, from {{inh|sv|non|kvikr}} (whence also {{cog|nb|kvikk}}, {{cog|nn|kvik}}, {{cog|is|kvikur}} and {{cog|fo|kvikur}}), from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*kwikwaz}}, whence also {{cog|en|quick}}. Ultimately from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*gʷih₃wós||alive}}.

